WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:07.583
Rainbow Reef was filled with fish.

2
00:00:07.584 --> 00:00:13.770
"It's too crowded!" Rita cried.

3
00:00:13.771 --> 00:00:16.735
Sasha hid behind a rock.

4
00:00:16.736 --> 00:00:19.763
"We can't even swim!"

5
00:00:19.764 --> 00:00:23.309
"There are too many fish," Cora said.

6
00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:27.566
"I'll ask them to leave."

7
00:00:27.567 --> 00:00:30.936
Cora swam over to a fish.

8
00:00:30.937 --> 00:00:35.932
"Hi, um, you fish seem very nice," she said.

9
00:00:35.933 --> 00:00:38.561
"But our reef is too crowded.

10
00:00:38.562 --> 00:00:39.847
Can you—?"

11
00:00:39.848 --> 00:00:43.936
"We love it here!" the fish said.

12
00:00:43.937 --> 00:00:50.456
Another fish nodded. "We're never leaving!"

13
00:00:50.457 --> 00:00:55.734
Cora sighed and swam back to Mo.

14
00:00:55.735 --> 00:01:02.812
"Maybe the compass can help us."

15
00:01:02.813 --> 00:01:06.116
In the cave Cora squirted her ink.

16
00:01:06.117 --> 00:01:09.837
The shell opened.

17
00:01:09.838 --> 00:01:14.494
Mo gasped. "Yikes!"

18
00:01:14.495 --> 00:01:18.553
The shell's picture showed a great white shark!

19
00:01:18.554 --> 00:01:22.151
"Relax, Mo," Cora said.

20
00:01:22.152 --> 00:01:24.811
"That shark could help us.

21
00:01:24.812 --> 00:01:28.327
It might scare away the fish."

22
00:01:28.328 --> 00:01:33.311
"Well, that hammerhead helped us once," Mo said.

23
00:01:33.312 --> 00:01:37.051
The arrow shot out of the cave.

24
00:01:37.052 --> 00:01:48.844
"Come on!" Cora said. "Let's follow it!"

25
00:01:48.845 --> 00:01:56.746
Finally the arrow stopped.

26
00:01:56.747 --> 00:02:02.996
"The shark!" Cora whispered.

27
00:02:02.997 --> 00:02:06.715
"Look at those teeth!" Mo said.

28
00:02:06.716 --> 00:02:09.786
The shark suddenly spotted them.

29
00:02:09.787 --> 00:02:15.642
"Yum! Time for lunch!"

